---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="post an entry">
  <h2>post an entry</h2>
  <p>Skills and settings are files in this repo. To add yours:</p>
  <ol>
    <li>Write the file at <code>src/content/entries/your-slug.md</code>.</li>
    <li>Match the schema: frontmatter below plus your SKILL.md text or setting prompt as the body.</li>
    <li>Open a PR against this repo.</li>
  </ol>
  <pre>---
title: "my skill"
summary: "one-line description of what it does"
kind: skill
category: coding
author: "you"
updated: 2026-09-20
tags: ["agents"]
status: submitted
install: "npx my-skill"
examples:
  - prompt: "do the thing"
    without: "agent output before the skill"
    with: "agent output after the skill"
---
Your SKILL.md body here. Settings use target/model
instead of install.</pre>
  <p>Every entry passes the <a href="/help">review bar</a> before it lists.</p>
</Base>
